
The image sequences in this directory are CIPR SIF sequences.
Images in the yuv directory are in YUV format, and images in
the ras directory are in Sun Rasterfile format.


+-----------+
+    YUV    +
+-----------+

Images in YUV format is planed-oriented, with all data for Y channel
comes first, followed by U and V dat

